\newlabel{fig:paradigms}{{1}{2}{Segmentation approaches arranged by their adaptation mechanisms. \hl {Expert-guided, LLM-driven methods can extend foundation-model pipelines by adding parameter adaptation with structured context and encoded expert knowledge. In this work, we test one such mechanism (R4Tun) under controlled, label-free, cross-LLM settings while keeping the underlying SAM4Tun pipeline fixed.}}{figure.caption.1}{}}
