\newlabel{tab:error-composition}{{9}{14}{\hl {Error composition as a fraction of ground-truth points (Opus-4.6 \mbox {$m+s+k$} versus SAM4Tun baseline; 3 regular, 2 complex tunnels). FN: segment predicted as background; FP: background predicted as segment; Swap: segment predicted as the wrong segment class. Adaptation reduces false negatives; the residual error is dominated by class swaps.}}{table.caption.20}{}}
